  "goodToKnow": "Die Sanierung means renovation, especially of buildings: die Sanierung der Altbauwohnung, energetische Sanierung (energy-efficient renovation), a big topic in German climate policy. It also means financial restructuring: die Sanierung einer Firma. Sanieren comes from Latin sanus (healthy): to make healthy again. Ein Sanierungsfall is a property or company in need of rescue. Saniert means renovated, a key word in flat ads."
